    "confidence": "moderate",
    "plain": "This package of benefit and pension increases would add very large amounts to public spending with no stated funding source, worsening the public finances. The main uncertainty is whether any tax rises or savings could fund it, but none are mentioned in the policy.",
    "biggest_unknown": "Whether the proposing party would offset these costs through tax rises or spending cuts elsewhere \u2014 the policy text states none, so the verdict is based on the policy as written.",
