        "claim": "A \u00a340/week increase represents a very large rise relative to standard upratings.",
        "evidence_id": "E1",
        "quote": "A weekly increase of \u00a340 would equate to approximately \u00a3160 a month, a much larger rise than recent standard upratings."
      },
      {
        "tier": "projected",
        "claim": "The OBR projects triple-lock pension spending to rise from 5% of GDP to 7.7% by the early 2070s, creating long-term structural fiscal pressure.",
        "evidence_id": "E28",
        "quote": "they project that the triple lock alone accounts for more than half of the projected increase in State Pension spending, which is set to rise from 5% of GDP (\u00a3138 billion a year) to 7.7% by the early 2070s."
      },
      {
        "tier": "measurable",
        "claim": "The bedroom tax currently generates approximately \u00a3434 million a year in deductions; scrapping it would reverse this saving.",
        "evidence_id": "E40",
        "quote": "In 2021/22, \u00a3434 million worth of deductions were made nationwide due to this policy."
      }
